{% comment %}
  Pagefind builds a static index from the rendered HTML at build time, so search
  works with no server and no third-party service — the site stays a pile of
  files. The UI mounts itself into #search once its script loads; if it has not
  been indexed yet (a bare `eleventy --serve`), nothing renders here.
{% endcomment %}
<div id="search" class="search" data-pagefind-ignore></div>
